# Friday Labs code ownership. Engineering Standard §4.
#
# CODEOWNERS is what turns "someone should review this" into an automatic
# reviewer request. One catch-all owner is mandatory; the rest is per-repo.
#
# GitHub matches the LAST matching rule, so put the catch-all first and
# narrow afterwards.

# Catch-all: every PR gets at least one owner.
*                           @Fridaylabsinc

# Anything that changes the gate itself needs the platform owner, because a
# change here silently changes what "green" means in every other PR.
/.github/                   @Fridaylabsinc
/.github/workflows/         @Fridaylabsinc
/.pre-commit-config.yaml    @Fridaylabsinc
/.editorconfig              @Fridaylabsinc
/CONTRIBUTING.md            @Fridaylabsinc

# Deploy and infrastructure: a wrong merge here is a production incident, not a
# failing test.
/deploy/                    @Fridaylabsinc
/*.sh                       @Fridaylabsinc
